<title>MALAYSIA: SOCCER-QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS AT WORLD YOUTH CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS AT WORLD YOUTH CUP.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of quarter-finals</p>
<p>at the Youth World Cup Finals on Sunday:</p>
<p>Argentina 2 Brazil 0</p>
<p>Halftime: 0-0</p>
<p>Scorers: Lionel Scaloni 78, Martin Perezlindo 90.</p>
<p>France 1 Uruguay 1 (after extra time, halftime 1-0, 90 mins</p>
<p>1-1).</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>France - David Trezeguet 26</p>
<p>Uruguay - Nicolas Olivera 67</p>
<p>Uruguay won 7-6 on penalties.</p>
<p>Ireland 1 Spain 0 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Trevor Molloy 50</p>
<p>Ghana 1 Japan 1 (halftime 1-0, 90 mins 1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Ghana - Joseph Ansah 8, Peter Ofori-Quaye (95 in sudden</p>
<p>death)</p>
<p>Japan - Atsushi Yanagisawa 79</p>
<p>Ghana won 1-0 in sudden death extra time</p>
</text>
